&lt;p&gt;These documents have been collected over the course of more than ten years of family research. Where possible, original publication details are noted below.&amp;#160;&lt;a href="#fnref:1" class="footnote-backref" role="doc-backlink"&gt;&amp;#x21a9;&amp;#xfe0e;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Maps</title><link>https://govhowell.org/resources/maps/</link><pubDate>Sat, 28 Feb 2015 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://govhowell.org/resources/maps/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Here are maps covering the period of Richard Howell&amp;rsquo;s life and the American Revolution. Also included are maps from the United Kingdom and specifically Wales.&lt;sup id="fnref:1"&gt;&lt;a href="#fn:1" class="footnote-ref" role="doc-noteref"&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
